WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:29.730
KNOW

01:33.240 --> 01:37.450
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.830 --> 01:41.620
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.620 --> 01:48.550
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various  daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.550 --> 01:51.720
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.720 --> 01:56.800
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.800 --> 02:00.680
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.680 --> 02:04.940
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.940
And then...

02:06.940 --> 02:10.400
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.400 --> 02:13.150
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:13.150 --> 02:18.280
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.750
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.750 --> 02:27.670
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.670 --> 02:33.930
bringing what should have been three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.760 --> 02:39.810
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:47.200 --> 02:50.130
THE GOLDEN CASTLE

03:02.840 --> 03:07.590
Yume, what is that person
thinking about now?

03:07.760 --> 03:10.990
Do you think we have
been forgotten already?

03:11.520 --> 03:15.200
Yume, do your dreams tell you anything?

03:15.840 --> 03:21.200
I can't see anything if the
person's heart is closed.

03:22.080 --> 03:25.910
We'll be together again, some day.

03:26.360 --> 03:30.880
If that person's plans are fulfilled, perhaps.

03:31.600 --> 03:35.590
Can we help somehow?

03:36.240 --> 03:38.280
Not now...

03:38.440 --> 03:41.990
but we may be able to if
we stay by Musashi's side.

03:42.600 --> 03:43.800
Who's there?

03:47.160 --> 03:50.280
Goemon Ishikawa, finally back!

03:51.000 --> 03:52.670
Goemon Ishikawa?

03:52.840 --> 03:55.720
Hideyoshi supposedly killed
him by boiling him alive.

03:56.280 --> 04:01.030
If I remember correctly,
you are his spiritual heir.

04:01.520 --> 04:04.430
Yume, do you know this man?

04:06.000 --> 04:07.400
I don't know you either!

04:07.920 --> 04:11.470
I saw him in a dream
when I was a prisoner.

04:11.680 --> 04:15.830
Are you an idiot perhaps?
You don't dream about strangers!

04:16.280 --> 04:19.110
Two seconds, let me think.

04:19.280 --> 04:21.270
She doesn't look like an idiot.

04:21.440 --> 04:23.640
A little woozy, maybe?

04:24.000 --> 04:25.200
I get it!

04:25.600 --> 04:27.400
What?

04:27.960 --> 04:33.430
You're enamored by my charm and
unmistakable class, you want to seduce me!

04:34.120 --> 04:37.590
Really?
You like him?

04:37.760 --> 04:40.430
No! Not you too, sister!

04:40.800 --> 04:44.240
Don't make that face, I get your game!

04:44.400 --> 04:47.470
I get you, but you're too much of a child for me!

04:47.640 --> 04:49.840
That would be illegal!

04:50.000 --> 04:53.110
On the other hand, there's no
problem with the other girl...

04:53.720 --> 04:55.600
Clearly.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.800
What a strange man.

04:58.520 --> 04:59.720
Yes.

05:00.280 --> 05:03.960
I understand, but don't fight over me.

05:04.120 --> 05:05.600
Yes.

05:05.920 --> 05:08.720
Goemon Ishikawa, if I'm not mistaken.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.800
What did you come to steal today?

05:12.280 --> 05:13.760
I recognize him...

05:13.920 --> 05:15.830
I'd rather forget...

05:16.000 --> 05:18.280
I came to steal the hearts of young ladies.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.920
You really are a bizarre fellow.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.950
They're making fun of me!

05:32.600 --> 05:35.640
So? What are you doing
here, Rokuemon Ishikawa?

05:35.800 --> 05:37.680
You?
Also...

05:38.320 --> 05:42.350
I'm Goemon!
Not Rokuemon!

05:42.520 --> 05:44.560
Are you looking for another spanking?

05:45.560 --> 05:48.070
Happyakurokujuhachi-emon Ishikawa!

05:48.480 --> 05:51.040
<i>Home run!</i>

06:07.960 --> 06:11.870
I'm glad we found a boat so quickly.

06:12.240 --> 06:18.280
Five-emon Ishikawa said he rented it off a fisherman, but I think he stole it.

06:18.720 --> 06:23.160
Doesn't that make us marauders?

06:23.560 --> 06:25.470
Probably.

06:26.080 --> 06:29.360
Marauders?
That has a nice ring to it.

06:29.520 --> 06:30.720
Yes!

06:31.280 --> 06:33.870
Goemon, let's forget about the boat.

06:34.040 --> 06:37.750
Instead, tell me why
you wanted to follow us.

06:38.160 --> 06:39.830
Out of pure goodness.

06:40.000 --> 06:45.230
When I see people in trouble, I feel obligated to help them.

06:45.400 --> 06:49.230
I'm not going to take revenge for the last time.

06:49.640 --> 06:51.310
The last time...

07:05.560 --> 07:07.710
I will not give this treasure to anyone!

07:07.880 --> 07:11.840
It is a precious gift from Mr. Hideyoshi!

07:12.000 --> 07:13.350
You will not have it!

07:13.880 --> 07:15.360
And who are you?

07:16.800 --> 07:18.950
Goemon Ishikawa!

07:20.600 --> 07:21.800
How classy!

07:21.960 --> 07:24.430
Goemon Ishikawa was boiled
alive in a cauldron!

07:24.960 --> 07:26.360
So who are you?

07:26.560 --> 07:31.040
A ninja. I'm his spiritual heir.
Rumors are circulating about you.

07:36.080 --> 07:37.990
Loser.

07:40.160 --> 07:41.990
Last time...

07:42.160 --> 07:46.040
Don't get me wrong!
I am not seeking revenge!

07:46.200 --> 07:50.400
In truth, Sado Island is
reputed for its gold mines.

07:50.560 --> 07:52.120
Besides, you are thieves.

07:52.320 --> 07:56.310
- A thief, me?
- We are partners!

07:56.960 --> 08:01.270
I was hoping to find treasure
by accompanying you.

08:01.640 --> 08:03.790
And we make it disappear, I guess.

08:04.120 --> 08:04.940
Yes.

08:04.960 --> 08:05.900
Yes.

08:05.920 --> 08:06.820
Yes.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.990
How did they find out?

08:09.440 --> 08:12.080
But that has nothing to do with it!

08:12.240 --> 08:15.680
I just want to cooperate, I'm serious!

08:18.040 --> 08:19.790
Something is heading toward us!

08:22.320 --> 08:23.990
It's going to hit us!

08:26.560 --> 08:27.760
Rasetsu?

08:27.920 --> 08:29.750
Brace yourselves!

08:33.840 --> 08:35.640
It went under!

08:35.920 --> 08:39.630
It's gigantic!
Yume, do you know what it is?

08:39.800 --> 08:41.310
A celestial guardian, right?

08:42.120 --> 08:44.710
Why would a celestial guardian be here?

09:11.320 --> 09:14.150
There are only crumbs left.

09:14.320 --> 09:17.040
Musashi has made a lot of progress.

09:17.200 --> 09:18.790
Are you there, Dabi-Dabi?

09:18.960 --> 09:20.160
Here!

09:20.520 --> 09:23.990
Hello?
Is Rasetsu broken?

09:24.160 --> 09:25.880
It's in pieces.

09:26.320 --> 09:28.360
Did Musashi do that to him?

09:29.080 --> 09:31.040
He has become strong.

09:31.560 --> 09:35.760
Isn't it hard for you to see
your creation destroyed?

09:36.040 --> 09:37.680
Of course it is!

09:37.840 --> 09:42.230
But I don't hold it against Musashi.

09:42.440 --> 09:46.480
What a magnanimous soul!
That's wonderful!

09:46.880 --> 09:50.030
I would be mad with rage if I was you!

09:50.480 --> 09:53.310
Dabi-Dabi, you are admirable!

09:54.600 --> 09:56.240
Flattery doesn't work.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.680
Damn it.

09:57.800 --> 10:00.630
Do you have anything to ask?

10:01.520 --> 10:04.160
- You could tell?
- What do you want?

10:04.720 --> 10:06.840
Why are you so embarrassed?

10:07.280 --> 10:08.480
Why...

10:09.000 --> 10:12.200
Do you want me to build something?

10:12.920 --> 10:16.310
I'm ashamed.
I'm so ashamed!

10:40.000 --> 10:43.920
Is this Sado Island?
Where are Musashi and the others?

10:49.160 --> 10:52.200
Ruko, go find my friends.

10:55.760 --> 10:59.200
The sixth artifact is in
the gold mine in Sado.

11:00.960 --> 11:05.350
The castle is made of solid
gold, inside a ravine.

11:05.560 --> 11:07.870
There will be an obstacle.

11:08.040 --> 11:14.110
A celestial guardian will appear to attack
anyone who tries to take the artifact.

11:15.000 --> 11:17.590
Kaguya, Yume!
Ronin, Sasuke!

11:19.040 --> 11:20.240
Ruko!

11:20.880 --> 11:22.080
Ruko...

11:23.720 --> 11:26.550
Princess Yume is safe.

11:26.720 --> 11:28.680
Musashi, too.

11:28.960 --> 11:32.110
Not so fast! Are you going
to abandon me or what?

11:32.280 --> 11:35.110
We have to find the others.

11:35.520 --> 11:39.590
Tell me, Ronin, this
bird is Ruko, isn't it?

11:39.760 --> 11:41.560
He spoke to me.

11:41.840 --> 11:45.600
Me too.
He told me to go to the east.

11:45.880 --> 11:49.560
Go find Danjo and Goemon, Ruko.

11:52.160 --> 11:54.470
Danjo is there!

11:57.640 --> 12:00.080
I found the golden castle!

12:01.920 --> 12:06.040
But how do I get down there?

12:06.320 --> 12:11.030
I'll think about it quietly
while waiting for the others.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.430
Ruko.

12:25.840 --> 12:30.070
The famous Musashi chooses his targets well. What a beautiful castle!

12:30.720 --> 12:34.920
Goemon Ishikawa, the
greatest thief in the country.

12:35.400 --> 12:39.190
He's doing well...
Goemon, do you want to outdo us?

12:40.120 --> 12:42.920
If that's a problem for you, come after me!

12:43.840 --> 12:48.310
Here we are at last,
Master Ronin and Desperado!

12:48.680 --> 12:52.510
Fantastic! We are right in
Zipang, the land of gold!

12:52.920 --> 12:58.800
Yes, and by the way,
Goemon went ahead of us.

12:59.280 --> 13:01.640
I'm going to throw a rope from the castle!

13:04.000 --> 13:07.470
That's the genius ninja
Sasuke Sarutobi for you!

13:07.760 --> 13:09.800
I'm going to throw the rope!

13:12.280 --> 13:14.720
This castle has no entrances.

13:14.880 --> 13:17.190
We'll just have to force our way through.

13:17.360 --> 13:18.840
Yume, do your usual!

13:19.240 --> 13:23.200
I never resort to violence.

13:23.360 --> 13:26.080
That's my sister's role.

13:26.240 --> 13:28.150
I also refuse!

13:28.320 --> 13:32.230
Melt the gold with your flammable bullet.

13:32.600 --> 13:35.480
I don't plan on holding back.

13:40.920 --> 13:43.830
Violent roles are for me!

13:44.000 --> 13:45.450
Flammable bullet!

13:53.960 --> 13:56.190
What are these sculptures?

14:02.840 --> 14:06.200
Musashi, these sculptures are alive.

14:06.360 --> 14:09.320
I feel an energy, even if it's faint.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.680
What do you mean?

14:10.920 --> 14:12.880
Yume, what does that mean?

14:13.520 --> 14:14.870
They're coming.

14:15.480 --> 14:18.310
What, who?

14:25.880 --> 14:29.480
Golden ayakashi?

14:45.760 --> 14:49.910
Why are ayakashi protecting the castle?

14:50.080 --> 14:56.150
I don't know, but I think we'll have to kill them to advance.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.520
Yes.

14:58.120 --> 15:00.480
We will not let you pass.

15:00.640 --> 15:05.790
Urashima has enchanted
us to defend this place.

15:06.280 --> 15:10.480
That is all very nice, but I don't care.

15:10.640 --> 15:13.200
I have no choice but to
put you down and move on.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.810
Ayakashi...

15:15.450 --> 15:18.350
we have Urashima's permission.

15:18.520 --> 15:22.200
We mean you no harm.
Let us pass.

15:22.360 --> 15:23.760
Exactly!

15:24.240 --> 15:27.360
That doesn't matter to us.

15:27.520 --> 15:30.750
We have no choice but to eliminate you here.

15:31.480 --> 15:33.360
I expected that.

15:33.520 --> 15:37.070
But we need the artifact!

15:37.240 --> 15:39.520
Let us pass!

15:39.760 --> 15:42.560
Wait, we're not ready!

15:42.720 --> 15:43.920
Sister!

15:44.600 --> 15:48.950
I have nothing against you
but you must let us pass!

15:55.320 --> 15:56.830
We have a mission!

16:06.960 --> 16:10.480
Step aside and let us pass!

16:11.120 --> 16:13.840
You're always so brutal!

16:14.000 --> 16:18.280
And why can that dagger damage gold?

16:19.000 --> 16:22.760
This dagger is a legacy from our mother.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.230
It's Moonflower, the Demon Assassin.

16:34.560 --> 16:36.710
Musashi, move aside!

16:52.480 --> 16:54.760
Yume, are they dead?

16:54.920 --> 16:57.590
No, not yet.

16:57.760 --> 17:00.560
Are they melted and still alive?

17:01.600 --> 17:03.990
Here we go again!

17:04.880 --> 17:07.350
This one has the strongest presence.

17:07.520 --> 17:10.030
It doesn't make any difference.

17:10.880 --> 17:14.950
Let's finish this quickly,
get the artifact and go home.

17:26.440 --> 17:29.480
Master Ronin, I feel something coming.

17:29.640 --> 17:30.870
Be careful.

17:31.360 --> 17:36.510
If a guardian comes, it means we are getting closer to the treasure.

17:36.680 --> 17:39.750
- Yes.
- Who is actually coming?

17:39.920 --> 17:42.310
If it's a ghost I can't do anything about it.

17:43.080 --> 17:47.310
I don't know, but I feel a great energy.

17:49.440 --> 17:52.160
Oh no, it had to be a ghost!

17:52.840 --> 17:54.190
Show time!

17:54.360 --> 17:56.830
A little exercise will do us good.

18:02.760 --> 18:05.480
Wait here, I'll come back to help you later!

18:06.040 --> 18:10.000
Later? We're in danger
of dying right now!

18:10.880 --> 18:14.190
It looks like we can at least breathe.

18:14.920 --> 18:19.600
This is disgusting!
Come help us now!

18:20.200 --> 18:23.640
I don't feel aggression in this ayakashi!

18:23.800 --> 18:25.200
Wait for me!

18:26.000 --> 18:28.040
We are counting on you!

18:32.080 --> 18:34.230
Fortune smiles on me!

18:34.760 --> 18:37.230
It's wonderful, I'm rich!

18:37.960 --> 18:40.110
Goemon, it's a trap!

18:40.520 --> 18:41.720
Sarutobi...

18:43.040 --> 18:44.690
Did you say something?

18:44.880 --> 18:46.920
I said it was a trap.

18:53.640 --> 18:55.360
Don't come near me!

18:55.520 --> 18:57.430
You're not my type!

18:58.160 --> 19:00.720
You make a cute couple, though!

19:00.880 --> 19:02.280
Are you kidding?

19:02.440 --> 19:05.430
I'll never marry a guy like him!

19:05.800 --> 19:08.520
You're doing better than me!

19:08.680 --> 19:10.910
It wasn't my fault.

19:11.520 --> 19:14.030
Let's start again, fat boy!

19:14.360 --> 19:15.630
Flammable bullet!

19:22.840 --> 19:25.120
The flammable bullet is freezing!

19:30.560 --> 19:34.840
My most powerful bullet is freezing?

19:38.840 --> 19:42.040
Death to those who want
to steal the artifact!

19:42.200 --> 19:45.240
I can't die here!

19:52.880 --> 19:54.080
Kaguya!

19:55.280 --> 19:56.840
Ruko!

20:04.560 --> 20:06.550
Yume!

20:08.040 --> 20:11.830
- Are you all right?
- Yes, help my sister.

20:12.000 --> 20:13.270
You got it!

20:15.520 --> 20:18.720
Master Takuan, lend me your strength!

20:19.200 --> 20:21.480
This bullet is a gamble!

20:22.320 --> 20:24.550
Extra-special Takuan bullet!

20:25.280 --> 20:26.480
Go ahead!

20:33.280 --> 20:34.480
Did I get him?

20:35.240 --> 20:39.150
Musashi, you're only freezing my sister further!

20:41.000 --> 20:44.280
Yes, it's no use against an ice monster!

20:44.720 --> 20:46.950
Sister!

20:48.360 --> 20:51.430
Sister, awaken your strength!

20:51.600 --> 20:53.110
The one you once had!

20:54.120 --> 20:57.880
THE MOON FLOATS

20:58.040 --> 21:01.870
IN THE DARK SKY

21:02.080 --> 21:09.080
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

21:10.040 --> 21:13.830
I HEAR THE SONG

21:14.000 --> 21:17.910
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

21:18.080 --> 21:21.960
LET US RETURN, LET US RETURN

21:22.120 --> 21:26.320
THERE WHERE THEY SING

21:27.040 --> 21:33.040
FULL MOON OF AUTUMN

21:34.920 --> 21:37.800
DISTANT LIGHT

21:37.960 --> 21:42.800
OF THE NATIVE LAND

21:43.040 --> 21:46.750
THAT CANNOT ILLUMINATE

21:46.960 --> 21:50.870
SUCH LASTING DARKNESS

21:51.040 --> 21:54.950
THOUGH YOU ARE SO FAR AWAY

21:55.120 --> 21:58.160
I THINK OF YOU

21:58.480 --> 22:02.360
AS I WAIT

22:02.520 --> 22:06.590
I WATCH THE EVENING CRANES

22:07.000 --> 22:13.000
WHEN WILL I SEE YOU AGAIN?

22:14.000 --> 22:17.630
THE MOON FLOATS

22:17.960 --> 22:21.950
IN THE DARK SKY

22:22.120 --> 22:29.110
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

22:30.000 --> 22:33.880
I HEAR THE SONG

22:34.040 --> 22:37.950
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

22:38.120 --> 22:41.480
LET US RETURN, LET US RETURN

22:42.120 --> 22:43.440
LET US RETURN

22:51.800 --> 22:53.000
Mother!

22:54.400 --> 22:59.430
Our mother's energy, her
benevolent love envelops Kaguya!

23:04.960 --> 23:06.160
What?

23:07.640 --> 23:08.840
Sister!

23:12.160 --> 23:15.390
Did you remember your Moon sorceress powers?

23:20.080 --> 23:21.640
What is happening?

23:23.840 --> 23:26.040
Are you Urashima?

23:26.640 --> 23:28.640
I am the sorceress of the Moon, Kaguya!

23:29.760 --> 23:31.990
I command the forces of the earth!

23:34.200 --> 23:37.720
Kaguya, don't forget we're here!

23:38.440 --> 23:40.670
Musashi, don't move!

23:45.680 --> 23:49.640
Kaguya is way more powerful than I thought.

23:50.640 --> 23:52.870
Ok, I'm not moving...

23:53.040 --> 23:55.160
but it feels dangerous!

23:56.520 --> 23:58.510
What are we gonna do?

25:31.320 --> 25:35.200
What? Only two episodes left?

25:35.400 --> 25:38.230
We don't have all the artifacts yet!

25:38.440 --> 25:42.200
It will all be fine?
No, that's not good at all!

25:42.400 --> 25:45.150
The next chapter: <i>Destruction</i>!
